ai"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line061-pei01-02","text":"臣闻恶不可积，过不可长；积恶长过，丧乱之源也。是以古人惧不闻非，故设进善之旌，立敢谏之鼓。武公九十，思闻警戒，诗美其德，士悦其行。臣察陛下无思警戒之义，而有积恶之渐，臣深忧之，此祸兆见矣。故略陈其要，写尽愚怀。陛下宜克己复礼，述脩前德，不可捐弃臣言，而放奢意。意奢情至，吏日欺民；民离则上不信下，下当疑上，骨肉相克，公子相奔。臣虽愚，闇於天命，以心审之，败不过二十稔也。臣常忿亡国之人夏桀、殷纣，亦不可使后人复忿陛下也。臣受国恩，奉朝三世，复以餘年，值遇陛下，不能循俗，与众沈浮。若比干、伍员，以忠见戮，以正见疑，自谓毕足，无所餘恨，灰身泉壤，无负先帝，原陛下九思，社稷存焉。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line061-pei01-02:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"xrt_zof_cbt","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line061-pei01-02:m0192","start":192,"end":194,"surface":"夏桀","kind":"person","person_id":"8zj_5p3_i5y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line061-pei01-02:m0195","start":195,"end":197,"surface":"殷纣","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line061-pei01-02:m0241","start":241,"end":243,"surface":"比干","kind":"person","person_id":"xtq_oi8_w82","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line061-pei01-02:m0244","start":244,"end":246,"surface":"伍员","kind":"person","person_id":"g9h_5ih_ug1_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":61,"last_line":61,"revision_id":2085162,"raw_start":6176,"raw_end":6464,"character_positions":[6176,6177,6178,6179,6180,6181,6182,6183,6184,6185,6186,6187,6188,6189,6190,6191,6192,6193,6194,6195,6196,6197,6198,6199,6200,6201,6202,6203,6204,6205,6206,6207,6208,6209,6210,6211,6212,6213,6214,6215,6216,6217,6218,6219,6220,6221,6222,6223,6224,6225,6226,6227,6228,6229,6230,6231,6232,6233,6234,6235,6236,6237,6238,6239,6240,6241,6242,6243,6244,6245,6246,6247,6248,6249,6250,6251,6252,6253,6254,6255,6256,6257,